| `arr` | `int[]` | Single-dimensional array of 15 integers |
| `i` | `int` | Outer loop index marking beginning of unsorted subarray |
| `j` | `int` | Inner loop index scanning for maximum element |
| `maxIndex` | `int` | Holds index of maximum element found in unsorted partition |
| `temp` | `int` | Temporary variable used for swapping |

